@WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5062
@ExternalReference = 6f1c2c8e-1d1f-4a53-9a3f-0d1d5f3a2b11

### Crear (201). Repetir la misma petición devuelve 200 con la misma solicitud.
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/service-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalReference": "{{ExternalReference}}",
  "customerId": "3b0e6f0a-8f6b-4c1e-9d55-1d3c2f7e9a01",
  "description": "Instalación de servicio"
}

### Mismo externalReference con datos distintos (409)
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/service-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalReference": "{{ExternalReference}}",
  "customerId": "3b0e6f0a-8f6b-4c1e-9d55-1d3c2f7e9a01",
  "description": "Otra descripción"
}

### Listar todas
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/service-requests
Accept: application/json

### Filtrar por estado (nombre o número)
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/service-requests?status=Pending
Accept: application/json
